   "stem_html": "<figure id=\"fig09\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/2b4366f8e7f2b5c0.png\" alt=\"Covered bodies on stretchers are in rows on a beach. Three men stand next to a stretcher while one man crouches down to it.\">\n<figcaption>Dead Marines on Iwo Jima, 1945.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p><i>Refer to the image provided.</i></p>\n<p>The scene depicted in the photograph influenced the decision to</p>",
